WEBVTT

1
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:17,940
It's rude to interrupt people eating snacks, mom

2
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,940
why are you here

3
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:25,220
Talk about it

4
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:29,640
What will you do if you are angry, my mother?

5
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:30,640
The fish was just kidding you

6
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:32,640
In fact, I have long missed my mother.

7
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:33,640
Talk about it

8
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:34,640
When did you think about it?

9
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:35,640
How long have you been thinking about it?

10
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:37,020
it's too late

11
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:38,020
You can stay here today

12
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:39,020
I have tidied up the room

13
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:41,020
No need to sleep with fish

14
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:42,020
My hotel has been booked
